<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] can merge with other living beings on a cellular level, both permanently (assimilation) and temporarily (amalgamation).-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Absorb.description>[PAWN_label]可以在细胞水平上与其他生物融合，永久 (同化) 和暂时 (融合)。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Absorb.description>
  <!--EN: Cellular absorbency-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Absorb.label>细胞吸收</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Absorb.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] can merge with other living beings on the cellular level, but only safely. Permanent integration is not possible.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Amalgamate.description>[PAWN_label]可以在细胞层面上与其他生物融合，但只能安全地进行。无法永久集成。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Amalgamate.description>
  <!--EN: Cellular amalgamation-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Amalgamate.label>细胞融合</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Amalgamate.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] can merge with other beings on the cellular level, but it's always a fatal process.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Assimilate.description>[PAWN_label]可以在细胞层面上与其他人融合，但这始终是一个致命的过程。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Assimilate.description>
  <!--EN: Cellular assimilation-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Assimilate.label>细胞同化</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_Assimilate.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] can melt live prey down to chemfuel in a number of locations on [PAWN_possessive] body.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertChemfuel.description>[PAWN_label]可以在多个位置将活着的猎物融化成化合燃料。[PAWN_possessive]身体。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertChemfuel.description>
  <!--EN: Olifactive enzymes-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertChemfuel.label>术酶</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertChemfuel.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] can melt live prey down to eggs in [PAWN_possessive] ovaries.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertEggs.description>[PAWN_label]可以将活着的猎物融化成卵[PAWN_possessive]卵巢。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertEggs.description>
  <!--EN: Ovifactive enzymes-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertEggs.label>产卵酶</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertEggs.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label]  can melt live prey down to fertilizer-grade urine in [PAWN_possessive] kidneys.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertUrine.description>[PAWN_label]可以将活着的猎物融化成肥料级的尿[PAWN_possessive]肾脏。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertUrine.description>
  <!--EN: Urifactive enzymes-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertUrine.label>化学酶</Enablers_Overstuffed_Goal_ConvertUrine.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has a bust deep enough to contain live prey.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Cleavage.description>[PAWN_label]拥有足以容纳活物的胸部。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Cleavage.description>
  <!--EN: Cleavage depth-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Cleavage.label>乳沟深度</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Cleavage.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has a permeable outer membrane which can be used to engulf live prey, like a slime.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Membrane.description>[PAWN_label]具有可被吞噬的活的外膜，比如史莱姆</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Membrane.description>
  <!--EN: Dermal porocity-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Membrane.label>皮肤拥挤</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Membrane.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has an untied and stretchy navel with which to ennavel live prey.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Navel.description>[PAWN_label]有一个解开的衣物和可伸展的肚脐，用以抓住猎物的肚脐。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Navel.description>
  <!--EN: Umbilical elasticity-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Navel.label>脐带弹力</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Navel.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has a maw on [PAWN_possessive] tail stretchy enough to pythen live prey.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Tailmaw.description>[PAWN_label]有一个大小姐[PAWN_possessive]一个突出的灵活附肢，是身体的一部分，通常从躯干的后部突出。不适用于没有腿的身体。有足够的拉伸力以将猎物点燃。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Tailmaw.description>
  <!--EN: Tailmaw elasticity-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Tailmaw.label>尾毛弹性</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Tailmaw.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] has udder teats stretchy enough to unnurse live prey.-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Udder.description>[PAWN_label]让乳房乳头有足够的弹性，可以拆解活的猎物。</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Udder.description>
  <!--EN: Uberal elasticity-->
  <Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Udder.label>旺盛的弹性</Enablers_Overstuffed_Type_Udder.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes amalgamating prey. The drain (on hunger and focus) isn't worth the gain.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶合并的猎物。消耗 (饥饿和专注) 是不值得的。</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Reclusive soul-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Dislikes.label>孤僻之魂</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As a melangist(e), [PAWN_label] enjoys having people around as sapient fat.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Likes.description>作为一个melangist(e),[PAWN_label]喜欢有肥胖的人在身边。</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Melangist-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Likes.label>机械之徒</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about amalgamating prey. That may or may not be due to [PAWN_label] not being capable of amalgamation in the first place.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎如何合并猎物。可能或可能不是由于[PAWN_label]一开始就不能合并。</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Amalgamation ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Neutral.label>合并矛盾情绪</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As an obsessive melangist(e), [PAWN_label] wants to walk around with as many people amalgamated onto [PAWN_objective] as [PAWN_pronoun] can fit, and will waste little time with other goals.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Obsessed.description>作为一个过度狂melangist(e),[PAWN_label]想要和尽可能多的人一起四处走动[PAWN_objective]机械体[PAWN_pronoun]能够达成目标，并且在实现其他目标时只会浪费少量的时间。</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Melangist hoarder-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Obsessed.label>梅兰吉派收集者</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates amalgamating prey and will never willingly do it. That's a degree of intimacy too close, a loss of privacy too great.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌合并猎物，绝不会心甘情愿地这么做。一个等级亲密太近，隐私损失太大。</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Solitary soul-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Refuses.label>独行</GoalPreference_Predator_Amalgamate_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't like permanently assimilating prey. Something less permanent or non-absorptive might be preferable.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]不喜欢永久同化猎物。不如永久性或非吸收性好。</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilation aversion-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Dislikes.label>厌恶同化</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As an assimilator, [PAWN_label] likes absorbing [PAWN_possessive] prey permanently. Getting targeted size-gains is one advantage over digestion.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Likes.description>作为一个同化者,[PAWN_label]喜欢吸收[PAWN_possessive]永久捕食。获得目标尺寸增益是比消化更好的优势。</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilator-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Likes.label>同化者</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about assimilating prey. That may or may not be due to [PAWN_label] not being capable of assimilation in the first place.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎如何同化猎物。可能或可能不是由于[PAWN_label]一开始就没有同化的能力。</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilation ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Neutral.label>同化矛盾心</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As an obsessive assimilator, [PAWN_label] wants to permanently absorb as many prey as possible and make [PAWN_possessive] assets huge.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Obsessed.description>作为一个痴迷的同化者,[PAWN_label]想要永久吸收尽可能多的猎物并制造[PAWN_possessive]巨大的资产。</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Driven assimilator-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Obsessed.label>驱动同化者</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates permanently assimilating prey and will never willingly do it. It's a perversion of the powers of absorption.-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌永久同化猎物，永远不会心甘情愿地这样做。这是对吸收能力的扭曲。</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilation revulsion-->
  <GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Refuses.label>反感同化</GoalPreference_Predator_Assimilate_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes being amalgamated. Either consciousness should cease before [PAWN_pronoun] enhances someone's assets, or [PAWN_pronoun] should be let go safe and sound.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶被合并。任一种意识应该在[PAWN_pronoun]提升某人的资产，或[PAWN_pronoun]应该平安释放。</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Amalgam aversion-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Dislikes.label>汞中毒厌恶</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As a tapissier(e), [PAWN_label] just likes to spend a while as padding on some predator. Not necessarily forever, mind.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Likes.description>作为一个tapissier(e),[PAWN_label]我只是喜欢待在一些捕食者身上。不一定永远,注意了。</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Tapissier-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Likes.label>尖刺的</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about being amalgamated.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎合并的方式。</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Amalgam ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Neutral.label>混杂矛盾</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As an obsessive tapissier(e) [PAWN_label] really wants to spend the rest of eternity absorbed, still-sapient, into some predator's body.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Obsessed.description>作为一个过度狂tapissier(e)[PAWN_label]好想拥有剩余的永恒尚未吸收的它被捕食者的身体吸收了。</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Pad-wish-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Obsessed.label>希望</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates being amalgamated. If you have to absorb [PAWN_objective], just take it all the way. Being a pred's *temporary* size-enhancer is a violation [PAWN_pronoun] would rather not live with.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]讨厌被合并。如果必须吸收[PAWN_objective],就这么一路带走吧。成为一名 pred 的 * 临时 * 尺寸增强装置是一种违规[PAWN_pronoun]不想和你一起生活。</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Amalgam revulsion-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Refuses.label>合并后厌恶</GoalPreference_Prey_Amalgamate_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] is put off by the idea of being made a permanent part of someone. There's at least a transience to mere digestion.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]因为要让自己永远成为某人的一部分而被推迟。至少可以暂时消化。</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilant aversion-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Dislikes.label>厌恶同化物</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: As an osmoseu(r/se), [PAWN_label] ideates an end in which [PAWN_pronoun] directly and visibly contributes to a predator's physical gains, by way of permanent absorption.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Likes.description>作为一个osmoseu(r/se),[PAWN_label]构想一个结局[PAWN_pronoun]直接而明显地有助于捕食者的身体收益的永久吸收的方式。</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Osmoseur-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Likes.label>刺猬</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about being assimilated.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎被同化。</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilant ambivalence-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Neutral.label>同化者矛盾心理</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: As an obsessive osmoseu(r/se), [PAWN_label] has made up [PAWN_possessive] mind. $PNom wants to make a predator even more beautiful, and only a permanent absorption is intimate enough to suffice.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Obsessed.description>作为一个过度狂osmoseu(r/se),[PAWN_label]已化妆[PAWN_possessive]意志。$ PNom 想要让一个捕食者变得更加美丽，并且只有永久的吸收是亲密的足够了。</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Meld-wish-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Obsessed.label>融合-希望</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] is terrified of being made a permanent part of someone, to be subject to all the degrading, animalistic things a pred might do with [PAWN_objective] after turning [PAWN_objective] into some body part or other.-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]害怕被人作为永久存在的一部分，遭受所有有辱人格的，泛灵的事情，一个 pred 可能会做[PAWN_objective]转向后[PAWN_objective]植入身体的某个部位或其他部位。</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Assimilant revulsion-->
  <GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Refuses.label>反感</GoalPreference_Prey_Assimilate_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: As a clumsy assimilator, [PAWN_label] will never improve the appearance of [PAWN_possessive] assets with assimilated prey, and all of the added fat will remain hideous as long as it's on [PAWN_possessive] body.-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Clumsy.description>作为一个笨拙的同化者,[PAWN_label]不会改善的外观[PAWN_possessive]装有被同化的猎物的资产，所有添加的脂肪只要被吸收就会变得丑陋[PAWN_possessive]身体。</PostVoreAssimilation_Clumsy.description>
  <!--EN: Clumsy assimilator-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Clumsy.label>笨拙的同化者</PostVoreAssimilation_Clumsy.label>
  <!--EN: As a masterful assimilator, [PAWN_label] will permanently improve the beauty of [PAWN_possessive] assets with assimilated prey.-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Masterful.description>作为一名精彩的同化者,[PAWN_label]将永久改善的美丽[PAWN_possessive]装有被同化的猎物的资产。</PostVoreAssimilation_Masterful.description>
  <!--EN: Masterful assimilator-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Masterful.label>精彩绝伦的同化者</PostVoreAssimilation_Masterful.label>
  <!--EN: As a normal assimilator, [PAWN_label] will temporarily improve the beauty of [PAWN_possessive] assets with reasonable amounts of assimilated prey, but may lose control of [PAWN_possessive] appearance with too much fat around.-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Normal.description>作为一个普通的同化者,[PAWN_label]将会暂时改善[PAWN_possessive]有合理数量的同化猎物的资产，但可能会失去对[PAWN_possessive]出现在肥胖的环境中。</PostVoreAssimilation_Normal.description>
  <!--EN: Normal assimilator-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Normal.label>普通同化者</PostVoreAssimilation_Normal.label>
  <!--EN: As an unaffected assimilator, [PAWN_label] will seamlessly integrate [PAWN_possessive] assets with assimilated prey, and nobody will ever notice the difference.-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Unaffected.description>作为一个未受影响的同化者,[PAWN_label]将无缝集成[PAWN_possessive]拥有被同化的猎物，没人会注意到区别。</PostVoreAssimilation_Unaffected.description>
  <!--EN: Unaffected assimilator-->
  <PostVoreAssimilation_Unaffected.label>未受影响的同化者</PostVoreAssimilation_Unaffected.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey. That's not supposed to be a hole.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]反感破裂[PAWN_possessive]猎物。那不应该是个洞。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Fissure-averse pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.label>厌恶裂隙的 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] likes fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey. Cleavage doesn't need to stretch as far beyond the norm, unlike other methods.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.description>[PAWN_label]喜欢碎裂[PAWN_possessive]猎物。乳沟不像其他方法，不需要伸展得太远而超出常规。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Fissurist pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.label>Fissurist pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about fissuring prey.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎用这种或那种方式切割猎物。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Fissure-ambivalent pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.label>裂隙-矛盾 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] loves fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey, to the exclusion of other types. No other type of vore makes it so easy to make out with prey on the way down.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.description>[PAWN_label]喜爱碎裂[PAWN_possessive]捕食的动物，拒绝其他类型的动物。没有其他类型的吃人这样在怀孕的时候就很容易和猎物亲昵了。</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.description>
  <!--EN: Ravenous fissurist pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.label>贪婪的 fissurist pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Obsessed.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] hates fissuring [PAWN_possessive] prey. It doesn't even deserve to be called vore.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶破裂[PAWN_possessive]猎物。它甚至不值得被召唤吃人</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.description>
  <!--EN: Fissure-abhorring pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.label>厌恶裂隙的 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Cleavage_Refuses.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] dislikes engulfing prey through [PAWN_possessive] permeable outer membrane. It's a good way to get filth and grime in your plasm.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.description>[PAWN_label]厌恶吞噬猎物[PAWN_possessive]可渗透的外膜。这是一个让你的血浆里有污物和污垢的好方法。</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.description>
  <!--EN: Dermal-averse pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.label>厌恶皮肤的 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Dislikes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] likes engulfing prey through [PAWN_possessive] permeable outer membrane, like a slime. Glomp!-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Likes.description>[PAWN_label]比如吞噬猎物[PAWN_possessive]可渗透的外膜，就像史莱姆Glomp!</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Likes.description>
  <!--EN: Dermacist pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Likes.label>Dermacist pred</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Likes.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] doesn't really care one way or the other about engulfing prey.-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.description>[PAWN_label]不在乎吞噬猎物的方式。</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.description>
  <!--EN: Dermal-ambivalent pred-->
  <TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.label>皮肤冲突 pred</TypePreference_Predator_Membrane_Neutral.label>
  <!--EN: [PAWN_label] loves engulfing prey through [PAWN_possessive] permeable outer membrane, like a slime. It's fun to walk around with prey like you've got a skeleton.-->
